{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>ויחדו</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, its companion in ויקהל, and the other: ויחדו כלם יכליון — to teach that the boards were flush with one another, that one would not go in and the other go out. Or, a hint to the one who says they were flush to a finger's breadth, and this is ויחדו כלם יכליון — that they were flush and proceeding:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:29.590616850Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}